      {
        "id": 254933,
        "name": "Jeysie",
        "username": "Jeysie",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
        "created_at": "2023-10-28T00:47:19.740Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"fjur\" data-post=\"28\" data-topic=\"30300\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/48/4849_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> fjur:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>The Inversiverse also has genderbent Fright Train.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>You know, you’d <em>think</em> I’d have remembered Express after remembering Flashbulb and all. Maybe I just need to join Wombat in the “obsessed with pretty boys” corner. (I wasn’t even a fan of pretty boys much before Sentinels, what did Adam wrought.)</p>\n<p>And I want art of all the Inversiverse peeps, you don’t even know. We need an Inversitober one of these years to go with Swaptober and Sentinels of the Night, lol.</p>",
